        <UserObject label="InventoryController" tooltip="InventoryController.cs - main/core file.&lt;div&gt;Owns the important references and main inventory behavior:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- current selected grid&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- currently held InventoryItemUI&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- item creation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- pickup/place/swap&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- rotate held item&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- cancel pickup&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- save/load JSON&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- finding the right placement grid&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This is basically the “inventory orchestrator.”&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;InventoryController.Input.cs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This file connects inventory actions to PlayerInputState.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It subscribes to events like:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Q create random item&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- U create and insert random item&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- left click pickup/place&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- right click rotate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This keeps Unity input callback stuff out of the main inventory logic.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;InventoryController.Pointer.cs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This handles cursor/pointer behavior.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It does things like:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- move the held item icon with the mouse&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- convert pointer position into grid tile position&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- adjust pointer position for multi-tile items&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- update hover/placement highlight&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- move picked-up items back under the canvas while dragged&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This is the most UI-feeling part of the controller.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;InventoryController.UI.cs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This wires inventory UI pieces together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It finds/registers:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- inventory panels&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- HUD panels&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- hotbar panel&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- GreyGrid&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- GridInteract&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- hotbar highlight row&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This file is mostly prefab setup glue.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;InventoryController.HotbarSync.cs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This syncs the inventory grid with the hotbar.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It does two directions:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;inventory row -&amp;gt; hotbar&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;hotbar -&amp;gt; inventory row&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Specifically, it treats row 2 in the main inventory grid as the row mirrored into the hotbar.&lt;/div&gt;" id="n5n4LlxRXR-YF48Y8tIj-64">
